<% layout('layouts/boilerplate') %>
<body>
  <div class="container-900px mx-auto my-2 px-1">
    <h1 class="mx-auto text-center display-4">
      Private Lesson Cancellation Policy
    </h1>
    <p>
      To respect both your time and mine, please review the following policy
      before booking:
    </p>
    <h2>1. Booking & Payment</h2>
    <p>
      All private lessons must be paid in full at the time of booking to reserve
      your lesson time.
    </p>
    <h2>2. Lesson Expiration</h2>
    <p>
      All private lessons must be scheduled and used within 6 months of
      purchase. Unused lessons after this period expire and are non-refundable.
    </p>
    <h2>3. Rescheduling</h2>
    <p>
      Lessons may be rescheduled with at least 24 hours notice at no additional
      cost.
    </p>
    <h2>4. Late Cancellations</h2>
    <p>
      Cancellations made with less than 24 hours notice will result in the
      lesson being forfeited, with no refund or credit issued.
    </p>
    <h2>5. No-Shows</h2>
    <p>
      Failure to attend a scheduled lesson without notice will result in
      forfeiture of the lesson, with no refund or credit.
    </p>
    <h2>6. Instructor Cancellations</h2>
    <p>
      If I need to cancel or reschedule a lesson, you may choose either a full
      refund or a rescheduled lesson at your convenience.
    </p>
    <h2>7. Emergencies</h2>
    <p>
      Genuine emergencies may be considered on a case-by-case basis at my
      discretion.
    </p>
    <h2>Agreement</h2>
    <p>By booking a lesson, you acknowledge and agree to this policy.</p>
  </div>
</body>
